{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b383d938-352a-4425-a364-3e3f27ce9306",
    "name": "vNext Test - Error Boundary",
    "description": "error-boundary-test-workflow (core, flow error-boundary-test-workflow / sys-flows).\n\n**Akış (otomatik geçişler):**\ninit-state → task-retry-state → task-ignore-state → task-log-state → priority-rules-state → state-level-test-state → notify-test-state → [notify-redirect] → rollback-test-state → [rollback-redirect] → global-abort-test-state → **Fault (status F)** — workflow geneli errorBoundary Abort (0).\n\n**Task-level örnekleri:** Retry+Ignore, Ignore, Log-only, öncelikli Ignore / Abort fallback, Notify (transition), Rollback (transition). **State-level:** state errorBoundary + Ignore.\n**Global:** global-abort-test-state içindeki hata → Abort.\n\nTüm görevler **error-script-task** (script); bu koleksiyonda **HTTP/Mockoon/Mocklab gerekmez**. `task-retry-state` retryPolicy PT1S×backoff içerir — `sync=true` ile başlatırsanız yanıt birkaç saniye sürebilir.\n\n**C# testleri:** `tests/Core/Tests/error-boundary-test-workflow/ErrorBoundaryTestWorkflowTests.cs` — milestone için GET instance `attributes` doğrulaması; tam akış sonunda fault beklenir.\n\n**functions/data / attributes ile uyumlu bayraklar (CSX):** errorTestStarted, testId; retryHandled; errorIgnored; logHandled; priorityRuleApplied; stateLevelHandled; notify-test sonrası notifyExecuted, notifyAt; rollback-test sonrası rollbackExecuted, rollbackAt.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4201",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiVersion",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "domain",
      "value": "core",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "workflow",
      "value": "error-boundary-test-workflow",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "errorBoundaryInstanceId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1) Instance başlat (sync — retry gecikmesi olabilir)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start?sync=true",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v{{apiVersion}}",
            "{{domain}}",
            "workflows",
            "{{workflow}}",
            "instances",
            "start"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "sync",
              "value": "true"
            }
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"key\": \"error-boundary-postman-{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"tags\": [\"integration-test\", \"error-boundary\", \"postman\"],\n  \"attributes\": {}\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "`start-error-test` → **init-state**. İlk görev InitErrorTestMapping (errorTestStarted, testId). Sonraki state’ler tamamen otomatik."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test(\"Start 200 ve id var\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property(\"id\");",
              "});",
              "if (jsonData && jsonData.id) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"errorBoundaryInstanceId\", jsonData.id);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2) State (long-poll / anlık)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{errorBoundaryInstanceId}}/functions/state",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": [
            "api",
